ons><non-patent-citations><nplcit status="new"><text>See also references of EP     1038985A1</text><sources><source name="SEA" created-by-npl="N"/></sources></nplcit></non-patent-citations></citations></technical-data><parties><applicants><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>ISHIZAKA YUKIO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>SUMITOMO METAL IND</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>ISHIZAKA, YUKIO</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SUMITOMO METAL INDUSTRIES, LTD.</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>ISHIZAKA YUKIO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>ISHIZAKA, YUKIO</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A clean steel which, when melted by electron beams that supply a total energy of more than 5000 J for the irradiation time of 10-25 seconds at an energy supply rate of 200-600 J/second per gram of steel sample, satisfies the area value requirement of 15000  mu m&lt;2&gt; or smaller for nonmetal inclusions present over the surface of the sample after solidifying. The steel has excellent cold working and fatigue resisting characteristics.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>Lorsque cet acier purifié est fondu par des faisceaux d'électrons dégageant une énergie totale de plus de 5000 joules pour un temps d'exposition compris entre 10 et 25 secondes et avec un taux d'énergie compris entre 200 et 600 joules par seconde par gramme d'échantillon d'acier, il satisfait aux exigences en matière de valeur d'aire inférieure ou égale à 15 000  mu m&lt;2&gt; relatives à des inclusions non métalliques présentes au-dessus de la surface dudit échantillon après solidification. Cet acier fait montre de remarquables qualités de travail à froid et de résistance à la fatigue.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>